# Keys inside the vaikhari screen, for Vayu's keybinding search
# (keybind-search.py reads ~/.tmux/plugins/*/scripts). Generated from
# internal/tui/keys.go by `go test ./internal/tui -update`; don't edit.
# keybind: Tmux/vaikhari | Ctrl+S | Post it now (LinkedIn goes out, X opens in your browser; asks first) (while writing)
# keybind: Tmux/vaikhari | Ctrl+T | Schedule it (tomorrow 9am, fri 6pm, in 2h...) (while writing)
# keybind: Tmux/vaikhari | Ctrl+D | Save it as a draft (while writing)
# keybind: Tmux/vaikhari | Ctrl+X | Toggle posting to X (while writing)
# keybind: Tmux/vaikhari | Ctrl+L | Toggle posting to LinkedIn (while writing)
# keybind: Tmux/vaikhari | Ctrl+O | Add an image (a path; Ctrl+O on an empty line removes them) (while writing)
# keybind: Tmux/vaikhari | Ctrl+N | Start a new post (the current one stays as it was saved) (while writing)
# keybind: Tmux/vaikhari | Esc | Leave the editor (the other keys work then) (while writing)
# keybind: Tmux/vaikhari | i / Enter | Edit the post (Compose tab)
# keybind: Tmux/vaikhari | Tab / Shift+Tab | Switch to the next / previous tab
# keybind: Tmux/vaikhari | 1 – 5 | Switch to Compose, Queue, Drafts, Posted or Settings (not while writing)
# keybind: Tmux/vaikhari | L | Open LinkedIn's sign-in again (it lasts 60 days; Settings sets it up)
# keybind: Tmux/vaikhari | ? | Show every key
# keybind: Tmux/vaikhari | q | Quit
# keybind: Tmux/vaikhari | j / k | Move to the next / previous post (Queue, Drafts, Posted)
# keybind: Tmux/vaikhari | Enter / e | Edit the post in Compose (Queue, Drafts, Posted)
# keybind: Tmux/vaikhari | p | Post it now (asks first) (Queue, Drafts, Posted)
# keybind: Tmux/vaikhari | t | Schedule it, or move it to another time (Queue, Drafts, Posted)
# keybind: Tmux/vaikhari | o | Open it on X's page to press Post (and confirm it after) (Queue, Drafts, Posted)
# keybind: Tmux/vaikhari | a | Approve an agent's post (Queue, Drafts, Posted)
# keybind: Tmux/vaikhari | n | Decline an agent's post (Queue, Drafts, Posted)
# keybind: Tmux/vaikhari | r | Send a post LinkedIn refused again (Queue, Drafts, Posted)
# keybind: Tmux/vaikhari | c | Cancel a scheduled or waiting post (Queue, Drafts, Posted)
# keybind: Tmux/vaikhari | d | Delete the draft (asks first) (Queue, Drafts, Posted)
# keybind: Tmux/vaikhari | y | Copy the post's link (Queue, Drafts, Posted)
# keybind: Tmux/vaikhari | v | Open the post's link in the browser (Queue, Drafts, Posted)
# keybind: Tmux/vaikhari | y | Approve it as asked (posts on every network it names) (approving an agent's post)
# keybind: Tmux/vaikhari | 1 | Approve it for LinkedIn only (when it asks for both) (approving an agent's post)
# keybind: Tmux/vaikhari | 2 | Approve it for X only (when it asks for both) (approving an agent's post)
# keybind: Tmux/vaikhari | t | Schedule it: approve it for another time (approving an agent's post)
# keybind: Tmux/vaikhari | e | Edit it first (Ctrl+S approves your version, Esc comes back) (approving an agent's post)
# keybind: Tmux/vaikhari | Tab / Shift+Tab | Switch to the next / previous capsule: the post, each network, each image (approving an agent's post)
# keybind: Tmux/vaikhari | o | Open the image full size (approving an agent's post)
# keybind: Tmux/vaikhari | j / k | Scroll the post when it's longer than its frame (approving an agent's post)
# keybind: Tmux/vaikhari | n | Decline it (nothing is posted, the agent is told) (approving an agent's post)
# keybind: Tmux/vaikhari | q / Esc | Leave it for later (it waits in Queue) (approving an agent's post)
# keybind: Tmux/vaikhari | j / k | Move to the next / previous field (Settings tab)
# keybind: Tmux/vaikhari | Enter | Edit the field (Enter finishes, Esc cancels it) (Settings tab)
# keybind: Tmux/vaikhari | Ctrl+S | Save the settings (signs in to LinkedIn if it needs that) (Settings tab)
# keybind: Tmux/vaikhari | Ctrl+L | Open LinkedIn's sign-in (saves your changes first) (Settings tab)
# keybind: Tmux/vaikhari | Ctrl+O | Open LinkedIn's page for creating your app (Settings tab)
# keybind: Tmux/vaikhari | Ctrl+Y | Copy the redirect URL for your LinkedIn app (Settings tab)
# keybind: Tmux/vaikhari | Esc | Leave Settings for Compose (Settings tab)
# keybind: Tmux/vaikhari | Enter | Confirm it's posted on X (paste its link first for a thread's next part) (X popup)
# keybind: Tmux/vaikhari | Ctrl+O | Open X's page again (X popup)
# keybind: Tmux/vaikhari | Ctrl+Y | Copy the image to your clipboard again (X popup)
# keybind: Tmux/vaikhari | Ctrl+K | Cancel X for this post (LinkedIn is unaffected) (X popup)
# keybind: Tmux/vaikhari | Esc | Leave it for later (it waits in Queue) (X popup)
# keybind: Tmux/vaikhari | Ctrl+Enter | Post it now, or schedule it when it has a time (vaikhari web)
# keybind: Tmux/vaikhari | Ctrl+S | Save it as a draft (vaikhari web)
# keybind: Tmux/vaikhari | Esc | Leave the open window (vaikhari web)
